# The documentation moved to docs.vale.sh, which GitBook publishes.
#
# These live here rather than in netlify.toml because adapter-netlify rejects
# a netlify.toml containing redirects -- it generates its own and will not
# merge with one.
#
# The slugs were reorganised in the move, so the specific rules come first and
# the catch-all last: Netlify takes the first rule that matches, and a bare
# /docs/* -> :splat would send a third of these to a 404. Every rule was checked
# against docs.vale.sh's sitemap.
#
# 301!, because these URLs have been the documentation for years and are widely
# linked: the redirect should be cached and should carry search ranking over,
# and the `!` applies it even once a file exists at the same path.

# Nine pages that were at the top level are now under topics/.
/docs/install         https://docs.vale.sh/topics/installation   301!
/docs/vale-ini        https://docs.vale.sh/topics/.vale.ini      301!
/docs/actions         https://docs.vale.sh/topics/actions        301!
/docs/cli             https://docs.vale.sh/topics/cli            301!
/docs/filters         https://docs.vale.sh/topics/filters        301!
/docs/scopes          https://docs.vale.sh/topics/scopes         301!
/docs/styles          https://docs.vale.sh/topics/styles         301!
/docs/templates       https://docs.vale.sh/topics/templates      301!
/docs/views           https://docs.vale.sh/topics/views          301!

# Sections and pages that were renamed.
/docs/fixers/*        https://docs.vale.sh/fixes/:splat          301!
/docs/formats/rst     https://docs.vale.sh/formats/restructuredtext  301!
/docs/guides/glob     https://docs.vale.sh/guides/globbing       301!
/docs/keys/vocab      https://docs.vale.sh/keys/vocabularies     301!

# `support` was an empty page and has no counterpart to point at.
/docs/support         https://docs.vale.sh/                      301!

# Everything else kept its path: checks/, keys/, formats/, guides/,
# integrations/, and the index.
/docs/*               https://docs.vale.sh/:splat                301!
/docs                 https://docs.vale.sh/                      301!

# The Voices demo moved into the announcement post.
/voices               /blog/voices                               301!
